{
  "_comment": [
    "Pre-made coloring pages for the Gallery and the Create dialog, in topics: the",
    "Gallery's sections, in this order. A page's \"topic\" files it under one of them.",
    "",
    "The pictures aren't in git. \"pictures\" says where they are, relative to this file",
    "(or a full URL): web/gallery/ locally, deployed to lsp with",
    "server/deploy/deploy-gallery.sh. A page's file names are in \"images\": \"page\" is its",
    "picture (one for either paper's shape; or \"portrait\" and \"landscape\"), and",
    "\"preview\" a small copy of it for the tiles (or \"thumb\", an emoji-like picture).",
    "Without \"images\" they're <id>-portrait.png, <id>-landscape.png and <id>-thumb.webp.",
    "",
    "The pages are colored pages, made with the same prompt as Create; set",
    "\"style\": \"lineArt\" for black-and-white ones. A page whose pictures are missing is",
    "left out of the Gallery; in Create, tapping it asks the generator instead.",
    "See web/README.md."
